commonmark, width 20:
# Title

A ~~struck~~ word
and a <b>raw</b>
tag.

plaintext, width 20:
Title

A ~struck~ word and
a raw tag.

xml:
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE document SYSTEM "CommonMark.dtd">
<document xmlns="http://commonmark.org/xml/1.0">
  <heading level="1">
    <text xml:space="preserve">Title</text>
  </heading>
  <paragraph>
    <text xml:space="preserve">A </text>
    <strikethrough>
      <text xml:space="preserve">struck</text>
    </strikethrough>
    <text xml:space="preserve"> word and a </text>
    <html_inline xml:space="preserve">&lt;b&gt;</html_inline>
    <text xml:space="preserve">raw</text>
    <html_inline xml:space="preserve">&lt;/b&gt;</html_inline>
    <text xml:space="preserve"> tag.</text>
  </paragraph>
</document>

